#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Eerste Schreed"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a short introduction to &kuser;. For more detailed information, see "
"<link linkend=\"using\">Usage</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actually, you do not need to do anything to begin using &kuser; except <link "
"linkend=\"customizing\">configuration</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not launch &kuser; in administrator mode, you will get a warning, "
"that the file <filename>/etc/shadow</filename> is not readable."
msgstr ""

